    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it is so quiet out here tonight. like, nothing at all. just the wind. sometimes i look out at the horizon and i just feel like... if i wasnt even here, nothing would change. the stars would still be there, the wind would still blow. it's like i don't even leave a dent in the world.",
