    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it does feel quiet. a peaceful kind of quiet, i guess, but also just... heavy. like it's all just waiting for nothing. everyone i know is so far away and they have their own lives, their own noise. out here it just feels like i'm already a ghost. like i've already drifted away and nobody even noticed.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
